  <section class="cp-faq" id="faq"><div class="cp-wrap"><h2>Questions a careful dog parent should ask.</h2><div class="cp-faq-list"><details><summary>How does the CalmPet Collar work?</summary><p>It keeps pheromone-based support close to your dog throughout the day. That continuous signal is designed to help lower background stress before familiar triggers arrive.</p></details><details><summary>Will it make my dog sleepy?</summary><p>CalmPet is drug free and non sedating. There are no pills, ingestibles, or foggy eyes. Your dog should remain completely themselves.</p></details><details><summary>How quickly should I expect a change?</summary><p>Every dog is different. Look for observable shifts such as easier settling, faster recovery, or a calmer response to familiar triggers. The 60-day guarantee gives you the full life of one collar to decide.</p></details><details><summary>Does it replace training or veterinary care?</summary><p>No. CalmPet is supportive care that can sit alongside training and an appropriate care plan. Sudden behavior changes, self injury, severe panic, or aggression should be discussed with a veterinarian or qualified behavior professional.</p></details><details><summary>How do I fit it?</summary><p>Adjust it comfortably around your dog's neck, confirm you can slide two fingers underneath, then trim the excess length. The maximum size is approximately 25 inches.</p></details><details><summary>What if it does not work for my dog?</summary><p>Email us within 60 days with your order number. You will receive a full refund. You do not need to return the used collar, and you do not need to argue your case.</p></details></div></div></section>

